- content_for :title, "Knowledge - Admin"

.flex.max-w-7xl.mx-auto.px-4.sm:px-6.lg:px-8.py-8.gap-8
  = render "sidebar", current_page: nil
  .flex-1.min-w-0
    .bg-white.rounded-xl.shadow.p-8.border.border-gray-100
      h1.text-2xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-2 Internal knowledge
      p.text-gray-600.mb-6
        | Shared internal docs for your team. Pages are only available under the admin area
        |  (
        code.text-sm = "(e.g. /en/admin/knowledge)"
        | ).
      .flex.flex-wrap.items-center.gap-3
        = link_to "New page", new_admin_wiki_page_path, class: "inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-700"
        = link_to "Formatting guide", admin_knowledge_formatting_guide_path, class: "inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-50"
